sequenceDiagram
  actor Teacher as 教师
  participant View as TeacherGradeTableView
  participant Controller as GradeAnalysisController
  participant Service as GradeAnalysisService
  participant Permission as CoursePermissionClient
  participant MemberRepo as CourseMemberRepository
  participant Version as GradeAnalysisSourceVersionStore
  participant SnapshotRepo as GradeAnalysisSnapshotRepository
  participant GradeRepo as GradeRecord/CourseGradeSummaryRepository
  Teacher->>View: 选择课程总评或成绩项维度
  View->>Controller: GET /courses/{courseId}/grade-analysis
  Controller->>Service: analyzeCourseGrades(courseId,teacherId,targetType,gradeItemId)
  Service->>Permission: 校验课程成绩管理权限
  Service->>MemberRepo: 读取当前有效学生集合
  Service->>Version: 读取目标来源版本与数据时间
  Service->>SnapshotRepo: 按课程和目标读取最近快照
  alt 契约/学生集合/来源版本指纹一致且计数完整
    SnapshotRepo-->>Service: 返回可复用快照
  else 快照缺失或失效
    Service->>GradeRepo: 读取目标成绩记录
    GradeRepo-->>Service: 分数与缺失状态
    Service->>Service: 计算指标、分布和空态计数
    Service->>SnapshotRepo: 保存新快照
  end
  Service-->>Controller: GradeAnalysisResult + sourceDataTime
  Controller-->>View: 指标或可解释空态
